        "body": "1. **Issue**\n   - PRs awaiting approval:\n     - feat(BE): Guardrail integration to standard RAG (#4155)\n     - f/be Guardrail: Banned phrase detection (#4289)\n     - f/be Guardrail: Implement allowed topics (#4377)\n   - Potential issue: NeMo Guardrails works better with older LLMs (GPT-3.5 vs 4.1+).\n   - Still testing for GPT-5, Claude Sonnet 4, Gemini 2.5 Flash.\n\n2. **Done**\n   - Phrase detection (FR-04 & FR-09) → awaiting review.\n   - Allowed topics (FR-02) → awaiting review.\n   - Topic input by code tested (“Customer Service?”).\n\n3. **WIP**\n   - Testing NeMo Guardrails across newer LLMs.\n   - Preparing project review demo (via GLChat).\n   - Clarification on hallucination detection vs groundedness.\n   - YAML config requested for security testing.\n   - Security testing planned for all OSS candidates.\n\n4. **TODO**\n   - Create LLM Invoker Adapter for NeMo Guardrail (refactor).\n   - Try open-source LLMs.\n   - Implement customizable fallback message.\n   - Implement masked output.\n   - Ensure all PRs reviewed, approved, and released before demo.\n   - Read materials on Trustworthy AI.\n",
